    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44116" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sicca</span></b> , ae, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a border-town on the
				east of Numidia</i>, with a temple of Venus, now <i>Kef</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 3, 2, § 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sall. J.
